#: advanceddialog.cpp:45
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Altnivelaj opcioj"

#: advanceddialog.cpp:171
msgid ""
"Specify the priority that the screensaver will run at. A higher priority may "
"mean that the screensaver runs faster, though may reduce the speed that "
"other programs run at while the screensaver is active."
msgstr ""
"Difini la prioritaton de la ekrankurteno. Pli alta prioritato signifas ke la "
"ekrankurteno estos pli rapida, dum aliaj programoj kiuj ruliĝas dum la "
"ekrankurteno ruliĝas estos malpli rapidaj."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:172
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the top left corner "
"of the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Difini la agon post teno de la muskursoro en la supre-maldekstra angulo de "
"la ekrano dum 15 sekundoj."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:173
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the top right corner "
"of the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Difini la agon post teno de la muskursoro en la supre-dekstra angulo de la "
"ekrano dum 15 sekundoj."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:174
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the bottom left "
"corner of the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Difini la agon post teno de la muskursoro en la malsupre-maldekstra angulo "
"de la ekrano dum 15 sekundoj."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:175
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the bottom right "
"corner of the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Difini la agon post teno de la muskursoro en la malsupre-dekstra angulo de "
"la ekrano dum 15 sekundoj."

